{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14102030","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14102030","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1410203001:0":{"text":"欢迎！欢迎！！非常欢迎！！！","source_cn":"欢迎！欢迎！！非常欢迎！！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BB29148DA204564","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410203002:1":{"text":"不知您是……？","source_cn":"不知您是……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD0946D163396AFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410203003:1":{"text":"在下弗林，是这座<style=\"highlight\">深岩村</style>的村长，非常荣幸能迎接诸位特使！","source_cn":"在下弗林，是这座<style=highlight>深岩...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x916D6391DE3FFCCF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410203004:1":{"text":"幸会，弗林村长，我是霍根，本次使节团的负责人。","source_cn":"幸会，弗林村长，我是霍根，本次使节团的负责人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96810561E9BC8305","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1410203005:1":{"text":"这位是<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>，使节团的魔法师，以及<male>他</male><female>她</female>的使魔们。","source_cn":"这位是<style=stress><player_na...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x84F5AE349040A716","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"这位是<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>，使节团的魔法师，以及<male>他</male><femal