,"document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1410203010:1":{"text":"弗林村长，你……不喜欢魔法师吗？","source_cn":"弗林村长，你……不喜欢魔法师吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1771B83F40068125","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1410203011:1":{"text":"哎呀呀呀……使魔大人！您这是说哪的话？","source_cn":"哎呀呀呀……使魔大人！您这是说哪的话？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x537C8384B940DA38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1410203012:1":{"text":"如果没有魔法师帮忙附魔，我们制造的武器压根发挥不出真正威力。","source_cn":"如果没有魔法师帮忙附魔，我们制造的武器压根发挥不出真正威力。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1380E5EB0002F534","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1410203013:1":{"text":"这倒是！我的主人曾经帮一位矮人为大炮附魔！那台大炮最后击沉了死潮舰队呢！","source_cn":"这倒是！我的主人曾经帮一位矮人为大炮附魔！那台大炮最后...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9DEF9D28C9F4AB0B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"这倒是！我的主人曾经帮一位矮人为大炮附魔！那台大炮最后击沉了死潮舰队呢！","female":"这倒是！我的主人曾经帮一位矮人为大炮附魔！那台大炮最后击沉了死潮舰队呢！","variant_male_record_index":"156048","variant_female_record_index":"156049","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1410203014:1":{"text":"嘘……主人都还没说话，你倒是先用主人的功绩逞上威风了。","source_cn":"嘘……主人都还没说话，你倒是先用主人的功绩逞上威风了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFB688FD041928AA9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"嘘……主人都还没说话，你倒是先用主人的功绩逞上威风了。","female":"嘘……主人都还没说话，你倒是先用主人的功绩逞上威风了。","vari