"say:28:1410203023:1":{"text":"如果获得这些天赋的代价是不被魔法接纳，那也值了！","source_cn":"如果获得这些天赋的代价是不被魔法接纳，那也值了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF5F359E1B334B97","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1410203024:1":{"text":"弗林村长真是乐观豪迈，我十分佩服。","source_cn":"弗林村长真是乐观豪迈，我十分佩服。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF1117AC8312D8AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1410203025:1":{"text":"感谢特使大人夸奖！先不说这些了。各位远道而来肯定累得够呛，走，我带你们去喝上一杯——","source_cn":"感谢特使大人夸奖！先不说这些了。各位远道而来肯定累得够...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7A7136B0E78D89F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1410203026:1":{"text":"承蒙美意。只是，我们还有任务在身，想要先确认武器订单的进度。","source_cn":"承蒙美意。只是，我们还有任务在身，想要先确认武器订单的进度。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65FA1B881D59C162","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1410203027:1":{"text":"您也知道，这次订单数量大，工艺也比较复杂。","source_cn":"您也知道，这次订单数量大，工艺也比较复杂。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEA629194C43A535","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1410203028:1":{"text":"就是之前的信函里提到的吧？您放一百个心，我们的质量和效率向来有保证！","source_cn":"就是之前的信函里提到的吧？您